selftest requires --suite <name>
usage:
  nanite-scene selftest --suite <name|all> [--verbose]
  nanite-scene deserialise-check <good|badjson|unknown>
  nanite-scene parallel-dot              M-E1b.5 solver graph DOT
suites:
  ecs-core    M-E0 World/Entity core (deferred add/remove, names, Hidden flags)
  ecs-hier    M-E1 components + hierarchy (world-matrix anchors, reparent, duplicate)
  ecs-system  M-E2 systems (signature matching, auto list, firstTick/tick)
  ecs-serial  M-E2 scene roundtrip (byte-identical, explicit rejections)
  ecs-parallel M-E1b.5 parallel tick (read/write solver, overlap proof,
              serial parity, structural-change guard)
  all         run every suite in order
